+  gts_evt_random.040240.name: "Message from a Distant Galaxy—No. 1266202"
+  gts_evt_random.040240.desc: "Deep in the distant Milky Way lies a tropical planet whose surface is 90 percent covered by warm, shallow seas. \n\nViewed from orbit, the vast ocean is dotted with countless islands of varying sizes and shapes, with milky-white sandy beaches stretching along the winding coastline, while lighthouses on sea reefs and high cliffs guide the bustling maritime trade day and night. The skyscrapers of coastal city-states spread out in tiered layers along the bays, and white-sailed cruise ships and sightseeing speedboats glide through the azure waters. This is a former faster-than-light civilization in the Atomic Age; its pleasant, global tropical climate has fostered a mild and harmonious cultural ethos. Under these conditions, numerous island city-states gradually united to achieve global unification in a remarkably peaceful and stable manner; this civilization, having never experienced the growing pains of upheaval, remains as innocent as a child. \n\nThe crystal-clear sea reflects the Milky Way, and people naturally assume that on planets high in the heavens—isolated like islands—there are still beings similar to themselves. Influenced by numerous factors, the civilization vigorously developed its tourism industry and established various facilities designed to accommodate extraterrestrial visitors of all kinds. They believed that such beautiful scenery and a mild climate would surely make any potential extraterrestrial visitors linger and refuse to leave. \n\nThus, this uninformed civilization erected a rudimentary deep-space radio array to convey their goodwill to the Milky Way. \n\n§H To provide all travelers who have journeyed across the starry seas—those bound by the pressures of work and their communities—with a haven free from constraints.§!\n\nThis promotional slogan, broadcast into deep space, is engraved on tourist monuments throughout the scenic areas and serves as the civilization’s steadfast creed for external outreach. \n\nThe looping broadcast, accompanied by the sound of waves, the coconut breeze, and light music, was transmitted into deep space day after day. Filled with anticipation, the local residents set up countless tourist rest stops on the beaches, kept berths vacant at the port year-round, and reserved large tracts of open land along the coast. \n\nEveryone is filled with goodwill, eagerly awaiting interstellar visitors from afar. Yet no one could have anticipated that this invitation would attract guests whose scale far exceeded their wildest imaginations."
+  gts_evt_random.040240.a: "Maybe we should give the big girls a little break."
+  gts_evt_random.040240.a.tooltip: "§Y can see the Giantess leaders in their swimsuits (slurp slurp slurp)§!"
+  gts_evt_random.040241.name: "Midsummer! Giantesses? A resort!"
+  gts_evt_random.040241.desc: "Seeing these Giantess leaders—who normally strategize from behind the scenes and hold up a vast empire—rushing about under the scorching sun was truly heartbreaking. \n\nSo the empire gave them a vacation. The Giantesses chose a vacation planet with a pleasant ecosystem, a planet that, though it had never ventured into deep space, was highly advanced in its own right. The indigenous people, driven by their warmth and hospitality, had vigorously developed tourism, transforming their world into a near-perfect model for a resort planet. They then used primitive deep-space broadcasts to promote it as an excellent destination for species across the galaxy to unwind and relax—which attracted a group of giant women who happened to be a place to unwind, relax, and have fun. And so...\n\nAccompanied by thunderous footsteps that parted the wind and crashed through the waves, six colossal Giantesses strode onto this azure coastline. The leaders, each with their own distinct personalities, had all changed into cool swimwear to enjoy this hard-earned holiday. \n\nThey were:\n\n§H Qinwen, Linfeng, Su Xiaobai, Ora, and Hitomi§!\n\nLogically, a group of five would have been enough, but the blue-haired girl before them, §B Shuoxuan§!, was Qinwen’s longtime close friend. Upon hearing that the “Giantesses” were scouring the entire universe for “summer retreats,” she made a special trip to join them. Since Shanshui vouched for her, we’re more than happy to have her join us for this getaway—maybe she’ll decide to join our group after she’s had her fill of fun!\n nWatching Niao Yin, Shuoxuan, and Ora treat the shallow waters of this coastline like a bathtub, splashing and frolicking to their hearts’ content, while at the feet of Linfeng, Hitomi, and Su Xiaobai’s enormous jade-like feet, steel battleships and city estates teetered precariously like toys. This is the true “Giantess-class” way to beat the heat. Since Shuoxuan is having fun and Niao Yin has shown a rare smile, it’s no big deal that a pre-faster-than-light-era indigenous civilization has become a gift to them. After all, when they’re happy, the universe is at peace."
+  gts_evt_random.040241.a: "I hope this civilization can survive under the beautiful, massive bodies of these six Giantesses."
+  gts_evt_random.040241.a.tooltip: "§YAfter all, it’s not every day you come across such a hospitable tiny person§!"
+  gts_evt_random.040242.name: "A Young Girl's Interactions with the City"
+  gts_evt_random.040242.desc: "Across the bay, three furry Giantesses were basking in the sun on the island in the distance. And high above this bustling coastline and city, another trio was blending into the holiday atmosphere with the utmost leisure. \n\nShuoxuan lay lightly suspended between the skyscrapers and the city, her pale yellow eyes brimming with tenderness. Compared to those Giantesses who casually use planets as Vibrators, she looked more like a pure, ordinary girl next door at that moment. Lying opposite her, Niao Yin rested her chin on her hand as she leaned against the edge of a skyscraper, pushing her half-frame glasses up with her fingertips—she, too, was of immense stature. \n\n§Y Sister Shuoxuan, though this city is small, it’s a place where the civilization of Tiny People has poured their heart and soul into preparing a summer retreat for us. Resting on a cloud and listening to the waves crashing against the shore is quite a pleasant pastime. Don’t worry—the Milky Way Broadcast already said we can play however we like; there won’t be any problems. §! \n\nNiao Yin was clearly quite attached to this “sister”; once she started talking, she enthusiastically began playing and fooling around with Shuoxuan.\n n In stark contrast, Ora, lying on the other side, was a completely different story. She was sprawled face-down on the beach, her massive, snow-white hands reaching unabashedly toward the bay below, her fingertips randomly churning the water and sending up waves of white foam that caused the boats below to rock violently.\n nThe resort’s tiny people, meanwhile, served as playthings to liven up the scene. Panicked, they steered their ships into the girls’ harbor. Although they’d prepared reception plans beforehand, coming into such close contact with such enormous girls for the first time still made their hearts race—yet the allure of the giant girls in swimsuits was simply too irresistible to resist. The Tiny People’s ships split into two groups: one cruised beneath Shuoxuan’s feet, while the other sailed beneath Ora’s giant hand.\n\nAs long as the girls didn’t treat the planet’s core like a punching bag, the Tiny People shouldn’t lose everything."
+  gts_evt_random.040242.a: "The little ones are in for a real treat."
+  gts_evt_random.040242.a.tooltip: "§Y Are there little creatures secretly crawling up the girls' bodies?§!"
+  gts_evt_random.040243.name: "A City That Feels Pitiful When Girls Are Shy"
+  gts_evt_random.040243.desc: "§M Shuoxuan, sis~ There are a few small boats heading this way toward you. §!\n\nA small fleet consisting of several frigates slowly made its way along the bay. Even though the crew members were sheltered inside steel warships weighing hundreds of metric tons, they couldn’t help but tremble in the presence of the two girls, who were as tall as mountains. \n\nIn this purely relaxed setting, Niao Yin set aside her archaic tone to enjoy this vacation with her sister Shuoxuan. Several helicopters slowly took off, quickly approaching and circling around the girls’ massive forms. \n\n§B, huh~? You’re here to liven things up for us~§! n\nShuoxuan paid no attention to the Tiny persons in the helicopters, who were speaking an unfamiliar alien language through loudspeakers in a tone bordering on pleading. Although she vaguely sensed that something was off, she pushed those feelings aside for the sake of her original goal: to relax and enjoy this vacation. After all, she had the ability to partially rewind time, so even if she did something wrong, it wouldn’t have much of an impact later on. \n\n§M Mm-hmm~ The tiny people on board are all here of their own accord to play with us~§!\n\nNiao Yin pushed up her glasses, a barely perceptible, mischievous smile flickering at the corner of her eye. \n\n§B So... they’re going to hit our chests~?§!\n\nIn a state of extreme panic, the fleet commander issued the attack order, and in an instant, all manner of artillery fire erupted into intense flashes of light across Shuoxuan’s chest. \n\nAlthough Shuoxuan was a gentle Giantess, her playful spirit was piqued at that very moment. She gently waved away the helicopters buzzing around her ears and reached out her hands toward the struggling fleet. \n\nHer slender hands gently grasped the two small boats; the vessels, weighing hundreds of metric tons, were instantly lifted into the air. She tossed one into the soft flesh of her breasts, while the other was tucked into the modest swimsuit worn by the demure Niao Yin standing beside her. \n\n§B Naughty~§!\n\nUpon hearing this, the last shred of reserve in Niao Yin’s heart vanished completely. She wrapped her arms around Shuoxuan’s waist and pressed herself against her as softly as a little kitten. \n\n§M Shuoxuan, big sis~ I want to…§!\n\nWith no formalities standing in her way, Niao Yin buried her warm cheek directly into Shuoxuan’s soft bosom. The poor escort ship bobbed up and down in the ocean of breast flesh, coming into intimate contact with Niao Yin’s delicate face. The sunlight warmed their skin until it felt slightly hot, and a wave of warmth—carrying a hint of each other’s body heat and the scent of milk—washed over them. Shuoxuan’s unique body scent instantly enveloped Niao Yin’s senses. Free from the tension of imperial affairs, she was simply a sweet little sister in this little world. Her nose gently brushed against that tender skin, and the sense of tranquility—being completely overwhelmed by tenderness, softness, and fragrance—made her close her eyes in comfort and let out a soft, contented moan. \n\n§Mmm... Sister Shuoxuan~ It’s so warm~§!\n\nFeeling the scorching body heat radiating from her “sister’s” skin, along with that unreserved doting affection, Niao Yin’s breathing gradually grew a bit more rapid. She casually picked up a large passenger bus loaded with passengers from the shore and held it between her lips. Following its soft curves, she slowly sat up and reached out to cup Shuoxuan’s face in her hands. Shuoxuan lowered her eyelids slightly, her rosy lips curving into a gentle smile as she met her. \n\nThe two were completely lost in their intimate embrace, oblivious to everything around them. However, a single careless movement by the Giantess while she was lost in tenderness proved to be a catastrophic disaster for the mortal world. Just as their lips and teeth were entwined in an intimate embrace, Niao Yin’s knee unconsciously shifted downward and pressed down, her enormous toes landing precisely in the city’s bustling district. A thunderous rumble echoed as more than a dozen skyscrapers, each hundreds of meters tall, collapsed with a crash under the unstoppable advance of her jade-like foot. Dust and debris surged in all directions, for a moment, cries of shock and screams echoed across the entire expanse beneath her foot, while the fleeing crowds and those kneeling in worship before the giant foot created a scene of utter absurdity. \n\nThe dust storm raged beneath their feet, yet they were so absorbed in savoring each other’s scent and tenderness that they didn’t even notice. After all, the city’s collapse was merely a minor interlude to liven up their holiday. Their lips parted briefly, and a delicate, crystalline silver thread—drawn from the poor bus—hung suspended between them. Shuoxuan was breathing slightly heavily, her clear eyes brimming with an unyielding tenderness, while Niao Yin’s face had long since flushed crimson, her very breath carrying the scorching heat of desire. \n\n§That’s not enough…§!\n\nNiao Yin murmured playfully, then leaned in again of her own accord. \n\nThis time, there was not a single gap between their two magnificent, jade-like bodies. Niao Yin tilted her head slightly, wrapped her arms tightly around Shuoxuan’s neck, and deepened the kiss fiercely; her soft tongue teased Shuoxuan’s lips, sending waves of pleasure into his mouth. Shuoxuan responded in kind, her slender fingers gliding over Niao Yin’s lower back as she gently caressed her waist. The sunlight cast a warm glow on their slightly flushed skin, and the unique, youthful scents—the scent of a young girl and the scent of milk—entwined completely in the air at that moment... n\n§Mmm… Shuoxuan’s lips are so soft…§!\n\nNiao Yin’s voice grew slightly muffled as their lips and teeth entwined; she was intoxicated by Shuoxuan’s body heat and scent, her body unconsciously leaning deeper into Shuoxuan’s embrace. However, with just that gentle nudge, their massive, delicate bodies shifted slightly. The outer side of Niao Yin’s voluptuous thigh pressed down on the cluster of cities beneath them, crushing them to dust, while Shuoxuan’s massive, jade-like foot—resting on the edge of the bay—unconsciously kicked backward in the heat of the moment, snapping the coastal bridge in two. \n\nDust and smoke swirled at their feet, but to the two suspended in midair, it was nothing more than a backdrop. Right now, neither the fate of the empire nor the survival of this city mattered nearly as much as the sensation of the young women’s fragrant lips against their own."
+  gts_evt_random.040243.a: "That's great—that's exactly the kind of smile I want to see!"
