+  gts_evt_random.040244.name: "Immersed in the Bird's Nest"
+  gts_evt_random.040244.desc: "On vacation? That’s interesting…\n\nIt’s hard to imagine a situation like this: a luxury cruise ship, having just set sail, is suddenly intercepted by an uninvited guest from outer space. \n\nShe had light orange braids, yet her figure was as massive as a colossus. The sea, which looked bottomless, barely reached the girl’s calves. People didn’t know what was happening, and they couldn’t believe the scene before their eyes. The girl simply gripped both sides of the deck with her fingers, and in the next moment, the entire ship began to rise gently between her fingers.\n\n§H Are you all here on vacation too? I just happen to know a little island… It’s a great spot for a vacation~§!\n\nAlthough the girl said this, she didn’t give the tiny people a choice. Before long, the boat suddenly pulled up to shore—\n\nonly to reveal another girl, her legs stretching endlessly across the sea’s surface, reaching all the way to the distant horizon. \n\n§H “All right, everyone. The ‘Maiden’s Island’ you booked has docked. Passengers, please disembark~” §!\n\nWho dares to get off? Not a single person present dared to try it. On the body of a Giantess as vast as an island, even the slightest movement… ...for these tiny people, even the slightest movement would be a catastrophe. But there was no choice. Even if not a single person dared to make a move, that didn’t mean Ora would let these tiny people off the hook—or Qinwen currently lying on the ocean’s surface.\n\n§H Alright then… I guess I’ll just have to step in as your tour guide for a bit. next stop is the ‘Bird’s Nest’~§!\n\n…What?\n\nAmid the crowd’s panic, the girl had already pushed the cruise ship into the sea, guiding it between Torine’s legs, while the other Giantess obligingly slipped off her swimsuit bottoms, revealing a moist, pink opening. At that moment, everyone realized what this so-called “Bird’s Nest” really was. People began jumping off the boat one after another, but how could such a small movement possibly escape detection between the girl’s legs?\n\nThe girl’s vagina glowed with a flushed hue, and the hot, damp scent seemed to lure the tiny people ever forward. Even as they surfaced for air after fleeing into the sea, they were forced to inhale the girl’s scent; their eyes would grow hazy, and they’d automatically swim into her realm of pleasure, waiting to lose their ability to resist bit by bit, gradually becoming a part of her… Yes, all they have to do is lie there… No more struggling to survive—after all, at this moment, every vacation becomes permanent, and all remaining time is categorized as “eternity.”\n\nIsn’t that wonderful?\n n Bird Sound put on her swimsuit, slightly tightening her vaginal muscles, but she no longer seemed to feel the Tiny people struggling inside her.\n\n§Memmmmmm, there’s no law against it, is there… It’s fine; I’m on vacation today. The Tiny people should be prepared for this sort of thing, right?§!"
+  gts_evt_random.040244.a: "I’m starting to envy the tiny people a bit."
