+  gts_evt_random.040245.name: "Deep Water—Keep Out"
+  gts_evt_random.040245.desc: "§H is really… a little tired…§! n\nHaving temporarily stepped away from the group, Ora, dressed in a swimsuit, returned to shore. She put on a sun hat and slipped into her custom-made rain boots—even on a sweltering summer day, when the other Giantesses were mostly bare, her outfit—which looked like something straight out of a photo shoot—still drew even more onlookers… Of course, there were plenty of people taking secret photos and whispering behind her back.\n\n§Y Hey, guys… why is this guy holding up a wooden sign to block the view up ahead…?\n\n“Deep Water—Keep Out”? Why would he put up a sign like that? Could it be that… §!\n\nAt the top of the TV tower, just as people were suddenly discussing this, everything suddenly went dark in front of them, and the crowd across the way began to look panicked:\n\nBecause the orange Giantess who had been on the beach just moments ago had now, using only her own body, completely surrounded this small TV tower. \n\n§H What are you guys talking about? Ora… I can’t hear you clearly. But—§!\n\n§H All I know is that I’m on leave today, so… if I’m not an administrator right now, doesn’t that mean I can do whatever I want without holding back?§! n\nAs the girl spoke, she opened her pink mouth. Everyone knew what lay within that bottomless pit—any person, building, ship, planet, or even an entire star system could gradually become part of her body, eroded by her stomach acid. Her pink tongue gently brushed against the outer surface of the TV tower; the glass it touched shattered instantly and was swallowed into her mouth with her breath. However, what was most terrifying were likely the tiny people who were about to become Ora’s special “snacks.” \n\nThen, as the girl breathed softly—yet with an unimaginable gravitational pull—her body was involuntarily drawn into that pink abyss. Until it was enveloped by the tongue’s surface, soft like moss, yet carrying a moist and warm breath. Yet his tightly encased body constantly sent him warning signals: right now, inside the girl’s mouth, if she so chose, he might forever remain as food to be digested; indeed, it wouldn’t be long before his tiny body—which he could scarcely fathom—would provide little emotional value to her bottomless stomach. At this thought, his body shuddered involuntarily. Yet even in the midst of this terror, he was hunted by the girl’s delicate senses. Perhaps… this Giantess just wants to see the panic on your face as she bullies you, leaving you completely helpless—but you really have no way out: after all, you were the one who walked into her lair in the first place, weren’t you?\n\n§H Alright… I’ll remember you, okay? Behave yourself, and I might just… savor you again someday. §!\n\nAs if I’d been tossed about in the underworld, I was spat out by the girl—intact, though—amidst a terror so suffocating I could barely breathe, like a piece of candy that had lost its emotional value. The tiny person curled up at the top of the TV tower, his clothes long since torn to shreds by the girl’s tongue and drenched in the Giantess’s saliva. But all in all, he’d managed to survive in her hands… in her mouth, hadn’t he?"
